  "contract": "Snapseed's chain (spell_ranks) is 804027, 503449-503454; Spell.dbc names 503453 'Rank 6' (BaseLevel 54) and 503454 'Rank 7' (BaseLevel 62), and AscensionSpellProgressionData sells them at 54 and 62. A level-57 Ranger holding ranks 1-5 is offered rank 6 as available (state 0) with rank 5 as its requirement, and buying it teaches it; rank 7 is unavailable (state 1) below level 62. The Bushcraft kit rows that name an ability as their requirement (Skinner's Grip 803866 needs 802809, Rider's Harness 803869 needs 800270) are unavailable until that ability is held, and the abilities themselves are sold as available rows, as are Bushcraft 573523 and Cure Light Leather 804790. A new Ranger holds skill 505 at 1. It does not test the client's window rendering.",
